onumber \end{align} and hence Eqs. \eqref{4th moment1}, \eqref{4th moment2} imply that  egin{equation} 	ext{Var}\left( rac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^n U^2_{ni}ight)ightarrow0\ \ 	ext{as}\ \ n	o\infty\,. \end{equation} Finally, the result follows since for each $n\geq1$, $E[ rac{1}{n}\sum\limits_{i=1}^n U^2_{ni}]=1$. \hfill \vrule height1.3ex width1.2ex depth-0.1ex
